1f:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Check the current call before treating a programme as open",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Check the current call before treating a programme as open"}],[["$","p","The European Commission overview was checked on 28 October 2026. It describes applications commonly running from October to January, with students applying directly to the selected programme. This is a planning window, not evidence that every 2027 scholarship is currently available.",{"children":"The European Commission overview was checked on 28 October 2026. It describes applications commonly running from October to January, with students applying directly to the selected programme. This is a planning window, not evidence that every 2027 scholarship is currently available."}],["$","p","Start from the official catalogue, follow the programme's own website and record the exact intake and scholarship deadline. If the page shows an older year, mark the next call as unconfirmed. A general admissions page or working portal login does not establish scholarship availability.",{"children":"Start from the official catalogue, follow the programme's own website and record the exact intake and scholarship deadline. If the page shows an older year, mark the next call as unconfirmed. A general admissions page or working portal login does not establish scholarship availability."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L23",null,{"id":"scholarships/erasmus-mundus:section-2","title":"Check your progress","items":["Confirm the programme and intended start year.","Find the current scholarship instructions, not only general admission.","Record closing date, time and time zone exactly as published.","Save the call URL and the date you checked it.","Recheck the programme page before paying or submitting."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://erasmus-plus.ec.europa.eu/opportunities/individuals/students/erasmus-mundus-joint-masters",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://erasmus-plus.ec.europa.eu/opportunities/individuals/students/erasmus-mundus-joint-masters","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"European Commission: Erasmus Mundus application route"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-How the programme model works",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How the programme model works"}],[["$","p","A Joint Master is designed and delivered by multiple higher-education institutions, often with study in more than one country. The consortium defines the curriculum, mobility path, degree award, entry requirements and application system.",{"children":"A Joint Master is designed and delivered by multiple higher-education institutions, often with study in more than one country. The consortium defines the curriculum, mobility path, degree award, entry requirements and application system."}],["$","p","There is no single application form covering every Joint Master. Search the current Erasmus Mundus catalogue, open each programme's own website and compare only courses that match your academic preparation and goals.",{"children":"There is no single application form covering every Joint Master. Search the current Erasmus Mundus catalogue, open each programme's own website and compare only courses that match your academic preparation and goals."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b"]}]
